{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b7731e190da4500bd5cb152e5151a1306625502759a954b93d753d0757ed7d1",
      "text": "各位，非常感谢大家今天特地\n前来观看我们的演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2beb258cfe1a9532fbe0bb648743deca615a20d786d31b81dce057d803eae119",
      "text": "不知在场的各位中，有先参观了展览会\n之后再来到这里的观众吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac5bab8f36d703c16e50719872f71b3bced413890be3e6cf209c45c5f18b883f",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀？看样子似乎还有没去过的客人喵。\n蝴蝶先生，这该如何是好喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1678bab2214c2406764635955c0bd809504827c6cd46fcd99ceb58ff19118b1",
      "text": "那么，就由我们向那些正打算前去的孩子们\n好好宣传一番吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279f82bbcbcdb570c1926c445db6f7377da98073b844c1156a2577106403531f",
      "text": "这次我们身上穿的演出服，以及所使用的道具，\n全都融合了日本传统工艺的技艺哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671985b192e11fe596f83c0eb6ea18cd3ffa69c7ed117c604c8de3d5f84a4136",
      "text": "亲自去会场找找对应的答案，感觉如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6294fb1df2ad5191088f0f1a7c803845b77b0a87ecb3ab3775ca3e225c00dce4",
      "text": "噢！真不愧是蝴蝶先生喵！\n看起来大家都变得兴致勃勃了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2253ebcf0798a30ca77a3bef06064e462cc429e92ec38c1eac4a0bcd37994fe",
      "text": "若是有兴趣的观众，请务必移步前往展览会\n看一看。演出结束后展馆也仍在开放。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34055281972568d8d6db45599e8a8ac3ebef8490a8de87bd4abf8b1c3adae41f",
      "text": "当然，改天再去也完全没问题喵～！\n语音导览会一直开放到展览会的最后一天喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
